// Font Awesome Free fonts, embedded into skeet.dll exactly as released (see third_party/fontawesome/README.md).
// Loaded by fontawesome.cpp with FindResourceW(L"FA_SOLID" ...) and registered as private process fonts.

FA_SOLID   RCDATA "third_party\\fontawesome\\fa-solid-900.otf"
FA_REGULAR RCDATA "third_party\\fontawesome\\fa-regular-400.otf"
FA_BRANDS  RCDATA "third_party\\fontawesome\\fa-brands-400.otf"
